{"_note":"来源与边界声明(标准 §7:数据来源必须在页面上说清楚)。这是包改名的由来 —— 它只看得见 App Store 的公开面,不接 App Store Connect(那要 .p8 私钥,撞零密钥硬闸)。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"t","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.foot}","fontSize":"11pt","lineSpacing":"4pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"5"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"foot":"评分与榜单来自 App Store 公开数据；下载、收益和审核来自你的 App Store Connect 密钥，只在这台设备上读取。"},"en-US":{"foot":"Ratings and charts come from public App Store data. Downloads, proceeds and reviews come from your App Store Connect key and are read on this device only."}}}}
